---
// TODO: have this reviewed by the hospital's legal/compliance advisor before launch.
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<LegalPage title="Medical disclaimer" description={`Medical disclaimer for the ${SITE.name} website.`} updated="October 2026">
  <p>
    The information on this website is provided by {SITE.name} for general educational purposes only. It is not a
    substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment.
  </p>

  <h2>No doctor–patient relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Reading this website, contacting us through a form or WhatsApp, or receiving a reply does not create a
    doctor–patient relationship. A diagnosis can only be made after a consultation and examination by a qualified
    doctor.
  </p>

  <h2>Always seek medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    Please consult a doctor about any symptoms or questions you have about a medical condition. Do not ignore
    professional advice or delay seeking it because of something you have read on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Emergencies</h2>
  <p>
    If you think you may have a medical emergency, call our 24×7 emergency line on
    <a href={`tel:${SITE.emergency.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`}>{SITE.emergency}</a> or go to the nearest emergency
    department straight away.
  </p>

  <h2>Treatments and outcomes</h2>
  <p>
    Descriptions of conditions and treatments are general. Every patient is different, and the suitability, recovery
    time and outcome of any treatment depend on individual circumstances. Your specialist will explain the options,
    benefits and risks that apply to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date, but medical knowledge changes and we cannot
    guarantee that every page is complete or current.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this disclaimer can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
